        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">This dataset includes a method of producing lithium manganese oxide out of manganese oxide and lithium carbonate by 2 rosting processes in inert atmosphere, followed by spray drying of a suspension and roasting again in a oxidising atmosphere in a rotary kiln.\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset includes rosting of manganese oxide and lithium carbonate in a inert atmosphere in a rotary kiln, followed by spray drying and roasting again in a oxidising atmosphere in a rotary kiln. Energy consumption and CO2 emissions to air are calculated</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
